    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapy feels like just another thing to manage. another person to explain this to. i feel like i'm just a caretaker for a ghost, waiting for the light to go out. sometimes i wonder if the only way to actually find some peace and stop this constant cycle of sadness is to just... reach the end of the road before everything falls apart completely anyway. it just feels like there's no other way to find actual stillness.",
